# --- Append-only session logs: chronological narrative, not architecture ---
# These are authoritative HISTORY, not structure, and they churn on every task
# (TASK_LOG.md ~660 KB, CURRENT_STATE.md ~490 KB, HANDOFF.md ~215 KB). Indexing
# them would dominate extraction cost and force a graph rebuild after every commit
# without adding a single structural edge. Agents must still READ them directly —
# they are the required-reading files in AGENTS.md and are never superseded by the
# graph. See docs/ai/GRAPHIFY.md § "What is intentionally excluded".
docs/ai/TASK_LOG.md
docs/ai/CURRENT_STATE.md
docs/ai/HANDOFF.md
